    "Hong Kong Companies Registry or GLEIF data showing that company number 3321489 / BRN 75743885 belongs to a different legal name, or that 'Alpa Hong Kong Ltd' is a distinct registered entity from the designated 'ALPA HONG KONG LIMITED' — the OFAC action would then not attach to the subject (this would more likely yield UNVERIFIABLE than NO_ADVERSE, since identity would be unresolved).",
    "A US court order enjoining or staying the 2025-09-16 designation (e.g., a preliminary injunction in a challenge to the IFSR/SDGT listing) still in force as of 2026-10-01, such that the entity is not effectively subject to the sanctions.",
